### lowercase sig-prefixed interrupt in sh
#!/bin/sh
trap 'echo bye' sigint
>>> SC3048 2:17
>>> SC3049 2:17

### uppercase SIG-prefixed interrupt in dash
#!/bin/dash
trap 'echo bye' SIGINT
>>> SC3048 2:17

### SIG-prefixed name in busybox is fine
#!/bin/busybox sh
# shellcheck shell=busybox
trap 'echo bye' EXIT SIGTERM
>>> none
